DESCRIPTION:Join us at Levy Park with Taoist Healing for Tai Chi and Meditation every Friday at 9 AM and every Thursday 6 PM. Practice Tai Chi to connect and focus the body and mind with slow\, low-impact gentle movements and stretches. Open to all ages and levels\, this class is great for those who want to de-stress\, find their inner peace\, and increase overall health.
